{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913190/extras/54939c774958477d1d2a3a40c0c68572.avif?t=1759494817\" width=1560 height=422 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coco is a little cat on a big adventure. Help her to uncover the mystery of the missing members of the Adventurers Guild in the charming Tambryn Valley. Along the way, you'll explore a cozy, vibrant world full of secrets, meet delightful characters, and solve thoughtful, story-driven puzzles. With a sprinkle of humor and a touch of self-awareness, Bravest Coconut invites you, the player, to also be a part of her story. It's a warm and whimsical tale of courage, connection, and finding your place in the world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through the cozy story while exploring the beautiful valley.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A full cast of quirky characters with countless nonlinear dialogue choices.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve a bunch of story-driven puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a long list of secrets and collectibles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple and fun combat system. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand crafted pixel art\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of handy accessibility options to craft a personalised playing experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catchy original soundtrack\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shenanigans</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2913190?t=1759494817","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2913190?t=1759494817","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_it